    "page:188:fact:1": {
      "entity_id": "page:188",
      "state": "supported",
      "reviewed_support": [
        {
          "quote": "\nThe default Machine, also known as the normal or striped Machine, is the most common Machine found on [[Floors]], with a 100% spawn chances in Floor 1, a 70% chance in Floors 2-4, a 55% chance in Floors 5-9, and a 40% chance the rest of the game. This Machine is quite simple—Your [[Toons]]' [[Extraction Speed]] determines how fast [[Ichor]] drips down from the Machine, meaning more {{Star}} for Extraction Speed make Machines finish faster. However, that isn't the only factor at play; [[Skill Check]] also determines how difficult they are when they appear. At a random time, a Skill Check will appear. It looks like a long gray bar with a much smaller silver bar placed randomly on it, as well as a golden bar in the middle of the silver bar. When hitting the silver bar, there will be text that says \"Good Job!\", while hitting the golden bar says \"Great Job!\" and adds a slight amount of completion to it, and failing to hit either of these results in nearby [[Twisteds]] being alerted to your location and Machine progress being halted. How large the gray/gold area and the completion given all depends on the Stars you have on Skill Check. When the [[Ichor]] is completely filled up, the Machine will no longer be extractable and will have an indicator for its completion.",
          "section": "Default Machine",
          "source_id": "page:16596",
          "revision_id": 260747,
          "content_sha256": "b359ac7127e2a1e4711c6e18fc36a0ec4469f7c79afa1ffaa013f5ee38a5cdd4",
          "revision_url": "https://dandys-world-robloxhorror.fandom.com/index.php?oldid=260747"
        }
      ],
      "text_contains": [
        "100% spawn chances in Floor 1",
        "70% chance in Floors 2-4",
        "55% chance in Floors 5-9",
        "40% chance the rest of the game",
        "Extraction Speed"
      ]
    },
    "page:16825:fact:1": {
      "entity_id": "page:16825",
      "state": "supported",
      "reviewed_support": [
        {
          "quote": "\nThe Circle Machine, also known as a round or dial Machine, is a Machine that's much similar to the default Machine, albeit having a circle above its valve. This Machine type only appears after [[Floor]] 1, with a spawn chances of 30% in Floors 2-4, a spawn chance of 35% in Floors 5-9, and a chance of 40% for the rest of the game. This Machine changes the [[Skill Check]] from a bar to a circle that randomly appears across the screen. Like the default Machine, you must press a button to complete progress, and there is a gray and golden area to hit, though unlike it, it doesn't stay in a set place, and unlike the normal Skill Check, the red circle shrinks into the gray area, then the golden area, before becoming blank and counting as a fail. Failing a Skill Check in this Machine results in [[Twisteds]] being alerted to your location, Machine progress being slowed, and a red text saying \"MISS\" will briefly appear shaking violently, of which does not appear when letting the red circle shrink oddly enough. More {{Star}} for Skill Check makes the bar slower, as seen with the Skill Check Speed [[Stat]], while [[Extraction Speed]] doesn't change the effect. Circle Machines also seem to give more progress than a regular Machine when landing a Skill Check.",
          "section": "Circle Machine",
          "source_id": "page:16596",
          "revision_id": 260747,
          "content_sha256": "b359ac7127e2a1e4711c6e18fc36a0ec4469f7c79afa1ffaa013f5ee38a5cdd4",
          "revision_url": "https://dandys-world-robloxhorror.fandom.com/index.php?oldid=260747"
        }
      ],
      "text_contains": [
        "only appears after Floor 1",
        "30% in Floors 2-4",
        "35% in Floors 5-9",
        "40% for the rest of the game",
        "seem to give more progress"
      ]
    },
    "page:18332:fact:1": {
      "entity_id": "page:18332",
      "state": "supported",
      "reviewed_support": [
        {
          "quote": "\nThe Treadmill Machine is, like the name implies, a Machine with a treadmill on it, as well as a triangular light that turns white as you run on the Machine, red when incomplete and green when completed. This Machine type only appears after [[Floor]] 4 with a spawn chances of 10%, before a 20% chance for the rest of the game. This Machine focuses more on [[Movement Speed]] and [[Stamina]], unlike the Default and Circle Machines, meaning [[Extraction Speed]] has no effect on this Machine's progression, and that Speed [[Trinkets]] or [[Items]] can quicken the extraction time too. You must run on the treadmill in order to complete the Machine, with using your Stamina to sprint making the extraction slightly faster. The [[Skill Check]] is different as it tells you to rapidly click space/tap the screen 4-8 times depending on your Skill Check {{Star}} to continue extracting; failing resulting in an significant reduction in your Movement Speed for 5 seconds.",
          "section": "Treadmill Machine",
          "source_id": "page:16596",
          "revision_id": 260747,
          "content_sha256": "b359ac7127e2a1e4711c6e18fc36a0ec4469f7c79afa1ffaa013f5ee38a5cdd4",
          "revision_url": "https://dandys-world-robloxhorror.fandom.com/index.php?oldid=260747"
        }
      ],
      "text_contains": [
        "only appears after Floor 4",
        "10%",
        "20%",
        "Extraction Speed has no effect",
        "4-8 times",
        "5 seconds"
      ]
    },
