          "quote": "\nWhen a Blackout is active, all environmental lights on the current [[Floor]] will be disabled, including miscellaneous light sources such as projectors, but excluding jukeboxes. Blackouts cannot occur before Floor 3. Upon passing Floor 3, the chance of a Blackout occurring starts at 5%, and increases by 2% after every completed Floor, capping at 30%.",
